# PC card team-path (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 12, TMODE-25/26, BENCH-124): arm tn (TMODE-26 NEAR, hunt at 250 px, added to the shipped TroodonPack entry), TroodonPack only, against master (the aa build). Template: tpprep writes work/team-path-tn.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
4900
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
plans/team-path-troodon.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@tn.jar
--robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@tn
--member
hadur2.Hadur
--out
work/team-path-@V@-tn
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-path-tn.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@aa
